('UM', 'UM169ac', 'Used  with  a  vertical  clearance,  indicating  an  ITP  clearance  when  there  is  one  reference  aircraft ahead.  Note.— No equivalent to ICAO Doc 4444.', 'ITP  BEHIND  [aircraft  identification]', 'R', 1, 1, 1),
