('UM', 'UM169o', 'Notification  of  the  secondary  frequency  for  the area.  Note.— Same intent as ICAO Doc 4444 UM  238.', 'SECONDARY  FREQUENCY [frequency]', 'R', 1, 1, 1),
('UM', 'UM169p', 'Notification  that  a  previously  issued  speed  can  be  expected  to  be  maintained  until  the  specified position or time.  Note.— No equivalent to ICAO Doc 4444.', 'EXPECT  TO  MAINTAIN  [speed]  UNTIL  [time  /  position]', 'R', 1, 1, 1),
