('UM', 'UM21', 'Instruction  that  at  the  specified  time  a  climb  to  the  specified  level  is  to  commence and once reached the specified  level is to be maintained.  Note 1.—  Instruction that NOT BEFORE  the specified time, a climb to the specified  level  is  to  commence  and  once  reached  the specified level is to be maintained.  Note  2.—    Precede  this  message  element  with  UM  19  MAINTAIN  [level],  to  prevent  the  premature  execution  of  the  instruction.', 'AT  [time]  CLIMB  TO  [level] or AT [time] CLIMB  TO  AND  MAINTAIN  [altitude]', 'W/U', 1, 0, 0),
